    <div class="card">
        <h1>About This Website</h1>
        <p>
            This website is about my favorite female superheroes.
            It allows users to view characters, see their details,
            add new characters, update existing ones, and delete characters.
        </p>
        <p>
            This project was built using Spring Boot, FreeMarker, and PostgreSQL.
        </p>
    </div>

</body>
